### Merchant self-registration (public)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "254707127309",
  "name": "Dickens"
}

### Create user — admin only (RIDER / ADMIN / AGENT)
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "254707127310",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "role": "RIDER"
}

### List users (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/users?page=0&size=20

### Get user by external ID
GET http://localhost:8080/users/{{externalId}}

### Update user
PATCH http://localhost:8080/users/{{externalId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe"
}

### Deactivate user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/{{externalId}}
